<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Q9z1" id=list-revoked-certificates>List revoked certificates<a href=#list-revoked-certificates class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to List revoked certificates" title="Direct link to List revoked certificates" translate=no>​</a></h3>
<p>This endpoint returns a list of serial numbers that have been revoked on the local cluster.</p>
<table><thead><tr><th style=text-align:left>Method<th style=text-align:left>Path<tbody><tr><td style=text-align:left><code>LIST</code><td style=text-align:left><code>/certs/revoked</code></table>
<h4 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Q9z1" id=parameters-13>Parameters<a href=#parameters-13 class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to Parameters" title="Direct link to Parameters" translate=no>​</a></h4>
<ul>
<li class="">
<p><code>after</code> <code>(string: "")</code> - Optional entry to begin listing after for
pagination; not required to exist.</p>
</li>
<li class="">
<p><code>limit</code> <code>(int: 0)</code> - Optional number of entries to return; defaults
to all entries.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Q9z1" id=sample-request-13>Sample request<a href=#sample-request-13 class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to Sample request" title="Direct link to Sample request" translate=no>​</a></h4>
