<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Q9z1" id=read-cel-role>Read CEL role<a href=#read-cel-role class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to Read CEL role" title="Direct link to Read CEL role" translate=no>​</a></h3>
<p>This endpoint queries the CEL role definition. It is useful to both operators and
users.</p>
<table><thead><tr><th style=text-align:left>Method<th style=text-align:left>Path<tbody><tr><td style=text-align:left><code>GET</code><td style=text-align:left><code>/pki/cel/roles/:name</code></table>
<h4 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Q9z1" id=parameters-15>Parameters<a href=#parameters-15 class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to Parameters" title="Direct link to Parameters" translate=no>​</a></h4>
<ul>
<li class=""><code>name</code> <code>(string: &lt;required>)</code> - Specifies the name of the role to read. This
is part of the request URL.</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Q9z1" id=sample-request-16>Sample request<a href=#sample-request-16 class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to Sample request" title="Direct link to Sample request" translate=no>​</a></h4>
