    "usage": "read-only,issuing-certificates,crl-signing"</span><br/></div><div class=token-line style=color:#393A34><span class="token plain">    "revocation_time": 1433269787,</span><br/></div><div class=token-line style=color:#393A34><span class="token plain">  }</span><br/></div><div class=token-line style=color:#393A34><span class="token plain">}</span><br/></div></code></pre></div></div>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Q9z1" id=delete-issuer>Delete issuer<a href=#delete-issuer class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to Delete issuer" title="Direct link to Delete issuer" translate=no>​</a></h3>
<p>This endpoint deletes the specified issuer. A warning is emitted and the
default is cleared if this issuer is the default issuer.</p>
<div class="theme-admonition theme-admonition-warning admonition_wBnh alert alert--warning"><div class=admonitionHeading_kByF><span class=admonitionIcon_jbvL><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path fill-rule=evenodd d="M8.893 1.5c-.183-.31-.52-.5-.887-.5s-.703.19-.886.5L.138 13.499a.98.98 0 0 0 0 1.001c.193.31.53.501.886.501h13.964c.367 0 .704-.19.877-.5a1.03 1.03 0 0 0 .01-1.002L8.893 1.5zm.133 11.497H6.987v-2.003h2.039v2.003zm0-3.004H6.987V5.987h2.039v4.006z"/></svg></span>warning</div><div class=admonitionContent_FvSw><p><strong>Note</strong>: If an issuer is incorrectly deleted, but its key material
remains, it is possible to re-import just the issuer certificate. The
<code>issuer_id</code> will change, but the name can be re-assigned to the new
issuer.</div></div>
<table><thead><tr><th style=text-align:left>Method<th style=text-align:left>Path<tbody><tr><td style=text-align:left><code>DELETE</code><td style=text-align:left><code>/pki/issuer/:issuer_ref</code></table>
<h4 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Q9z1" id=sample-request-33>Sample request<a href=#sample-request-33 class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to Sample request" title="Direct link to Sample request" translate=no>​</a></h4>
