<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Q9z1" id=set-keys-configuration>Set keys configuration<a href=#set-keys-configuration class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to Set keys configuration" title="Direct link to Set keys configuration" translate=no>​</a></h3>
<p>This endpoint allows setting the value of the default key.</p>
<table><thead><tr><th style=text-align:left>Method<th style=text-align:left>Path<tbody><tr><td style=text-align:left><code>POST</code><td style=text-align:left><code>/pki/config/keys</code></table>
<h4 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Q9z1" id=parameters-39>Parameters<a href=#parameters-39 class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to Parameters" title="Direct link to Parameters" translate=no>​</a></h4>
<ul>
<li class=""><code>default</code> <code>(string: "")</code> - Specifies the default key (by reference;
either a name or an ID).</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Q9z1" id=sample-payload-19>Sample payload<a href=#sample-payload-19 class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to Sample payload" title="Direct link to Sample payload" translate=no>​</a></h4>
<div class="language-json codeBlockContainer_e91z theme-code-block" style=--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa><div class=codeBlockContent_G3Pk><pre tabindex=0 class="prism-code language-json codeBlock_H5oe thin-scrollbar" style=color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa><code class=codeBlockLines_OQl4><div class=token-line style=color:#393A34><span class="token punctuation" style=color:#393A34>{</span><span class="token plain"></span><br/></div><div class=token-line style=color:#393A34><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token property" style=color:#36acaa>"default"</span><span class="token operator" style=color:#393A34>:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token string" style=color:#e3116c>"baadd98d-ec5a-66ac-06b7-dfc91c02c9cf"</span><span class="token plain"></span><br/></div><div class=token-line style=color:#393A34><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token punctuation" style=color:#393A34>}</span><br/></div></code></pre></div></div>
